UK_FIT = " Calibration from the previous generation of this exact token: the design was right, but the golden trident tines and the tall dorsal fin crossed the outer rim of the disc. This time keep the same shark-headed sea-teal dragon, the same pose and colours, but draw the WHOLE creature clearly smaller, with the trident SHORT and held close to the body, its tines pointing up-left but ending well inside the disc, at least a sixth of the disc radius away from the disc edge, and the dorsal fin low and short. Every part of him, the trident and fin included, sits inside a circle of about two thirds of the disc radius."
retry('ukllmswwik', 5, comp=COMP + FIT + DRAKE + UK_FIT)

